"Damage Senjata dilipatgandakan 0.85x."

#. Folder evolution mode - name (chaos)
#. source: Chaos
msgid "EVO.chaos.name"
msgstr "Ricuh"

#. Folder evolution mode - description (chaos)
#. source: A inconsistent unpredictable mess of difficulty. I couldn't tell you what to expect.
msgid "EVO.chaos.description"
msgstr ""
"Tingkat kesulitan yang sangat tidak bisa diprediksi, bahkan saya tidak bisa "
"memberitahu apa yang bisa dinantikan."

#. Folder evolution mode - name (linear)
#. source: Linear
msgid "EVO.linear.name"
msgstr "Linier"

#. Folder evolution mode - description (linear)
#. source: A consistent linear stream of more enemies being added over time.
msgid "EVO.linear.description"
msgstr ""
"Segerembolan musuh akan datang seiring waktu secara konsisten dan linier."

#. Folder evolution mode - name (variable)
#. source: Variable
msgid "EVO.variable.name"
msgstr "Variatif"

#. Folder evolution mode - description (variable)
#. source: A varied level of enemies that ramps up and down to give more moments of peace but harder increases.
msgid "EVO.variable.description"
msgstr ""
"Musuh datang dengan level-level berbeda. Memungkinkan lebih banyak waktu "
"lenggang namun upgrade kesulitan lebih terasa."

