#. Scene label
#. screens: end_screen.tscn
msgid ""
"You did it! I'm proud of you! I hope you had fun.\n"
"\n"
"However I am very sorry that this is such a boring and uninspired win "
"screen. You deserve better and you will get better - in the full release.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, enjoy trying some of the harder difficulties, go spend "
"those Beanz on some upgrades and try out some different builds.\n"
"\n"
"If you had fun during this demo be sure to give it a wishlist or follow on "
"Steam - there's so much more to come!"
msgstr ""
"Anda sudah selesai! Semoga menyenangkan!\n"
"\n"
"Namun saya sangat minta maaf bahwa layar ini masih terlihat membosankan. "
"Anda berhak mendapatkan yang lebih bagus. Dan anda akan mendapatkannya di "
"versi full.\n"
"\n"
"Sementara itu anda bisa menikmati tingkat-tingkat kesulitan yang lebih "
"dalam, mungkin anda juga bisa menggunakan Beanz untuk upgrade.\n"
"\n"
"Jika anda puas memainkan demo ini, silahkan bisa dimasukkan ke Wishlist atau "
"follow di Steam - bakal banyak fitur baru yang akan datang!"

